Emerald 3DS changes to pret/pokeemerald 76463dac15cad36aca5e2b3f6366abf9e53f814f: Korean text (Hangul two-byte codes)
Applies after 0056-follower-pokemon.patch; apply with tools/bootstrap.py.

Korean build only (GAME_LANGUAGE == LANGUAGE_KOREAN): RenderText reads a Hangul
lead byte (0x37-0x41) with its trail byte, GetStringWidth measures the pair, and
the glyph functions draw Hangul from the port's Hangul font tables.

